WEBVTT


00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.287
With just a phone, 

00:00:01.287 --> 00:00:02.600
you can make videos.

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.440
AI with Google flow is extremely simple

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.120
Today I will guide you step by step.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.680
Create a video that can be done.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.400
First, 

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.080
open Google and search for Google Flow.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.560
and then click on the path shown as on the screen

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.360
When entering the flow interface select New project to create a new project.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.120
In this you can create both free images and videos

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:25.280
AI first go to the image section to choose the appropriate image ratio.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.640
Usually TikTok videos should be selected not vertical nine out of 16.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.120
then select the AI configuration you want to use

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.120
Next click upload photo

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.640
put in a product photo and a character photo

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.640
then write the request statement

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.720
AI Tell characters to wear the right outfit or hold the right product

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.720
click create and wait for the processing system to get a new image

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.915
when you like the photo switch to the video 

00:00:45.915 --> 00:00:47.440
section select the photo you just created

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.120
set the ratio of nine to 16

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.200
select video duration and configuration

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.600
paste the motion command and click render

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.600
waiting for AI to finish

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:56.880
You open the results.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.638
If you choose to download it to your phone, 

00:00:58.638 --> 00:01:00.200
you can immediately post a video on TikTok.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.000
Reels or Affiliate

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.840
Do you need an image and motion statement template?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.000
comment prom

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:07.160
I'll send it right away.
